          "args": {
            "CodeContent": "/* \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n   STYLESHEET: MẸO THI BẰNG N.SOWN\n   Tone màu chủ đạo: Xanh dương (#1976d2, #0d47a1) \u0026 Trắng (#ffffff)\n   Giao diện hiện đại, mượt mà tương tự App Ôn Tập GPLX\n   \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d */\n\n:root {\n  --primary-blue: #1976d2;\n  --primary-dark: #0d47a1;\n  --primary-light: #e3f2fd;\n  --primary-accent: #2196f3;\n  --color-gold: #f59e0b;\n  --color-gold-light: #fef3c7;\n  --color-gold-dark: #b45309;\n  --color-success: #10b981;\n  --color-danger: #ef4444;\n  --color-danger-light: #fee2e2;\n  --color-warning: #f59e0b;\n  --color-text-main: #1e293b;\n  --color-text-muted: #64748b;\n  --color-bg-light: #f8fafc;\n  --color-card-bg: #ffffff;\n  --border-color: #e2e8f0;\n  --radius-sm: 8px;\n  --radius-md: 12px;\n  --radius-lg: 18px;\n  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.08);\n  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 25px rgba(13, 71, 161, 0.12);\n  --font-family: \u0027Plus Jakarta Sans\u0027, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0027Segoe UI\u0027, Roboto, sans-serif;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: var(--font-family);\n  background-color: #f1f5f9;\n  color: var(--color-text-main);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n/* APP SHELL CHUẨN APP DI ĐỘNG \u0026 DESKTOP */\n.app-layout {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 580px; /* Định dạng mobile-first sang trọng */\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  background-color: var(--color-bg-light);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  position: relative;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 900px) {\n  .app-layout {\n    max-width: 720px;\n    margin: 12px auto;\n    min-height: calc(100vh - 24px);\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n}\n\n/* ---------------- HEADER ---------------- */\n.app-header {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-dark) 0%, var(--primary-blue) 100%);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 50;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n}\n\n.header-content {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.header-brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.app-logo {\n  width: 44px;\n  height: 44px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 2px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n}\n\n.brand-text h1 {\n  font-size: 1.05rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.brand-slogan {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n\n.header-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.btn-tier-badge {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 5px 9px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-tier-badge:hover {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);\n}\n\n.tier-label {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  opacity: 0.85;\n}\n\n.tier-val {\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  color: var(--primary-dark);\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.user-quick-status {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.gold-badge {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n  padding: 4px 8px;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.btn-add-mini {\n  background: var(--color-gold);\n  color: #000;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.vip-badge {\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 3px;\n}\n\n.vip-badge.vip {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffd700 0%, #ff9800 100%);\n  color: #854d0e;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\n.vip-badge.free {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.btn-user-avatar {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  width: 32px;\n  height: 32px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-size: 14px;\n}\n\n.notice-bar {\n  background-color: #0c3b82;\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  padding: 6px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  color: #ffeb3b;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.notice-text {\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  animation: marquee 22s linear infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes marquee {\n  0% { transform: translateX(100%); }\n  100% { transform: translateX(-100%); }\n}\n\n/* ---------------- MAIN CONTAINER \u0026 TABS ---------------- */\n.app-main {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 16px;\n  padding-bottom: 84px; /* Chừa không gian cho bottom navigation */\n}\n\n.tab-pane {\n  display: none;\n  animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.tab-pane.active {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n@keyframes fadeIn {\n  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(4px); }\n  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n/* ---------------- HERO CARD ---------------- */\n.hero-card {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 18px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.hero-card::after {\n  content: \u0027⚡\u0027;\n  position: absolute;\n  right: -10px;\n  bottom: -20px;\n  font-size: 110px;\n  opacity: 0.08;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.hero-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #f59e0b;\n  color: #000000;\n  font-size: 0.68rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff, #93c5fd);\n  -webkit-background-clip: text;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n\n.hero-desc {\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  color: #cbd5e1;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.hero-stats {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.stat-pill {\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.btn-hero {\n  width: 100%;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  padding: 10px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- SECTION TITLE \u0026 FEATURE GRID ---------------- */\n.section-title {\n  font-size: 0.98rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-main);\n  margin: 16px 0 10px 0;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.feature-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n.feature-card {\n  background-color: var(--color-card-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 14px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  position: relative;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.feature-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n  border-color: var(--primary-accent);\n}\n\n.feature-card .card-icon {\n  font-size: 26px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.feature-card .card-title {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-main);\n  margin-bottom: 2px;\n}\n\n.feature-card .card-subtitle {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n.feature-card .card-arrow {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 12px;\n  bottom: 10px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: #94a3b8;\n}\n\n.feature-card.highlight {\n  border: 2px solid #f59e0b;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #fffbeb 100%);\n}\n\n.badge-hot {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 10px;\n  right: 10px;\n  background: #ef4444;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  padding: 1px 6px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n.feature-card.vip-promo {\n  border: 2px solid #8b5cf6;\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f5f3ff 100%);\n}\n\n/* CATEGORY LIST */\n.category-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.cat-item {\n  background-color: var(--color-card-bg);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  padding: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.cat-item:hover {\n  background-color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.cat-icon-wrap {\n  width: 42px;\n  height: 42px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 20px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.bg-blue { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }\n.bg-teal { background: #ccfbf1; color: #0f766e; }\n.bg-purple { background: #f3e8ff; color: #7e22ce; }\n.bg-indigo { background: #e0e7ff; color: #3730a3; }\n\n.cat-details {\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.cat-name {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-main);\n}\n\n.cat-meta {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n}\n\n.cat-go {\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n}\n\n/* ---------------- PRACTICE / STUDY SCREEN ---------------- */\n.practice-header {\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.practice-filters {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 6px;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  padding-bottom: 8px;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n}\n\n.practice-filters::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.filter-pill {\n  padding: 6px 14px;\n  background-color: var(--color-card-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s;\n}\n\n.filter-pill.active {\n  background-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(25, 118, 210, 0.3);\n}\n\n.vip-status-bar {\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-top: 6px;\n}\n\n.vip-status-bar.free {\n  background-color: #fff7ed;\n  border: 1px solid #fed7aa;\n  color: #9a3412;\n}\n\n.vip-status-bar.vip {\n  background-color: #ecfdf5;\n  border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;\n  color: #065f46;\n}\n\n/* QUESTION CARD */\n.question-card {\n  background-color: var(--color-card-bg);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  padding: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.qcard-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.q-badge-num {\n  background: var(--primary-light);\n  color: var(--primary-dark);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n.q-badge-critical {\n  background: #fee2e2;\n  color: #b91c1c;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.q-text {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #0f172a;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.q-image-container {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin: 12px 0;\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  padding: 10px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n}\n\n.q-image-container svg {\n  max-width: 220px;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\n.options-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.option-item {\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: #334155;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 10px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.option-item:hover {\n  border-color: #94a3b8;\n  background-color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.option-item.selected {\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  background-color: #f0f7ff;\n}\n\n.option-item.correct {\n  border-color: #10b981;\n  background-color: #ecfdf5;\n  color: #065f46;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.option-item.wrong {\n  border-color: #ef4444;\n  background-color: #fef2f2;\n  color: #991b1b;\n}\n\n.opt-radio-circle {\n  width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  border: 2px solid #94a3b8;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.option-item.selected .opt-radio-circle {\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n}\n\n.option-item.selected .opt-radio-circle::after {\n  content: \u0027\u0027;\n  width: 10px;\n  height: 10px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: var(--primary-blue);\n}\n\n.option-item.correct .opt-radio-circle {\n  border-color: #10b981;\n  background-color: #10b981;\n}\n\n.option-item.wrong .opt-radio-circle {\n  border-color: #ef4444;\n  background-color: #ef4444;\n}\n\n/* \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n   TÍNH NĂNG CỐT LÕI ĐỘC QUYỀN: KHUNG MẸO TRẢ LỜI NHANH 3S\n   \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d */\n.quick-tip-card {\n  margin-top: 14px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);\n  border: 2px solid #f59e0b;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffbeb 0%, #ffffff 100%);\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.quick-tip-header {\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f59e0b 0%, #d97706 100%);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 7px 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n}\n\n.qtip-title {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n}\n\n.qtip-speed-badge {\n  background: #000000;\n  color: #fef08a;\n  padding: 1px 7px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  font-size: 0.68rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.quick-tip-body {\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n}\n\n.tip-keyword-row {\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 6px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n}\n\n.keyword-label {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #92400e;\n}\n\n.keyword-tag {\n  background: #dc2626;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(220, 38, 38, 0.3);\n}\n\n.tip-rule-box {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  color: #1e293b;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;\n}\n\n.tip-mnemonic-text {\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #b45309;\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\n/* TRẠNG THÁI KHÓA MẸO TRẢ LỜI NHANH (CHO USER THƯỜNG TỪ CÂU 4 TRỞ ĐI) */\n.quick-tip-card.locked .quick-tip-body {\n  filter: blur(5px);\n  user-select: none;\n  opacity: 0.45;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.tip-lock-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 32px;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n  text-align: center;\n  z-index: 5;\n}\n\n.lock-shield-icon {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.lock-title-text {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: #b91c1c;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.lock-desc-text {\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  color: #475569;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  max-width: 320px;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n}\n\n.btn-lock-upgrade {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b 0%, #ea580c 100%);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 7px 16px;\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.35);\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.btn-lock-upgrade:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.03);\n}\n\n.explanation-toggle-btn {\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  color: #64748b;\n  font-size: 0.76rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 6px 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.explanation-box {\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 10px;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  color: #334155;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- EXAM SIMULATION (THI THỬ) ---------------- */\n.exam-intro-card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 24px 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.exam-badge-icon {\n  font-size: 46px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.exam-title {\n  font-size: 1.3rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--primary-dark);\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.exam-intro-desc {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n}\n\n.exam-rules-box {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 14px;\n  text-align: left;\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n}\n\n.rule-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 7px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px dashed #e2e8f0;\n  font-size: 0.84rem;\n}\n\n.rule-row:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.rule-title {\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n}\n\n.rule-val {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-main);\n}\n\n.rule-row.danger .rule-title {\n  color: #dc2626;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.exam-top-bar {\n  background: var(--primary-dark);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.exam-countdown {\n  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  color: #ffeb3b;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.exam-palette-wrap {\n  margin-top: 14px;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 12px;\n}\n\n.palette-header {\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.exam-palette-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 480px) {\n  .exam-palette-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(8, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n\n.palette-btn {\n  aspect-ratio: 1;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color);\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  color: #334155;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n\n.palette-btn.current {\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  background-color: var(--primary-light);\n  color: var(--primary-dark);\n}\n\n.palette-btn.answered {\n  background-color: #10b981;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border-color: #10b981;\n}\n\n/* EXAM RESULTS */\n.result-status-card {\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  padding: 24px 16px;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n}\n\n.result-status-card.pass {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #10b981 100%);\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.result-status-card.fail {\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc2626 0%, #ef4444 100%);\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.result-big-icon {\n  font-size: 52px;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.result-score-text {\n  font-size: 2.2rem;\n  font-weight: 900;\n  margin: 6px 0;\n}\n\n.result-action-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- BIỂN BÁO GIAO THÔNG ---------------- */\n.signs-header {\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.input-search {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border: 1.5px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n.input-search:focus {\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n}\n\n.signs-tabs {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 6px;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  scrollbar-width: none;\n}\n\n.sign-tab-btn {\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  background-color: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.sign-tab-btn.active {\n  background-color: var(--primary-blue);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border-color: var(--primary-blue);\n}\n\n.signs-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.sign-card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.sign-svg-wrap {\n  width: 76px;\n  height: 76px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.sign-code-tag {\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  color: var(--primary-dark);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  padding: 2px 6px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.sign-name-text {\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--color-text-main);\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.sign-desc-text {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.35;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- THEORY CHEAT SHEETS ---------------- */\n.theory-tips-header {\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.theory-card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  padding: 16px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.theory-card-title {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--primary-dark);\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-light);\n  padding-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.theory-content {\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  line-height: 1.55;\n  color: #334155;\n}\n\n.theory-content h3 {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: #0f172a;\n  margin: 12px 0 6px 0;\n}\n\n.theory-content ul {\n  padding-left: 18px;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.theory-content li {\n  margin-bottom: 5px;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- PROFILE TAB ---------------- */\n.profile-card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  padding: 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 14px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.profile-avatar {\n  width: 58px;\n  height: 58px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--primary-light);\n  color: var(--primary-blue);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 28px;\n}\n\n.profile-badges {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 6px;\n  margin-top: 6px;\n}\n\n.badge-tag {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 2px 8px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n}\n\n.badge-tag.free { background: #e2e8f0; color: #475569; }\n.badge-tag.vip { background: #fef08a; color: #854d0e; }\n.badge-tag.gold { background: #ffedd5; color: #9a3412; }\n\n.profile-menu-list {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.pmenu-item {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 14px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s;\n}\n\n.pmenu-item:hover {\n  background: #f8fafc;\n  border-color: #cbd5e1;\n}\n\n.pmenu-icon {\n  font-size: 22px;\n}\n\n.pmenu-text {\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.pmenu-title {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n}\n\n.pmenu-desc {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n}\n\n.pmenu-arrow {\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n/* ---------------- ADMIN DASHBOARD ---------------- */\n.admin-header-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.admin-title {\n  font-size: 1.15rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--primary-dark);\n}\n\n.admin-subtitle {\n  font-size: 0.75rem;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n}\n\n.admin-stats-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 480px) {\n  .admin-stats-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n\n.stat-card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 12px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.stat-num {\n  font-size: 1.35rem;\n  font-weight: 900;\n}\n\n.stat-lbl {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  color: var(--color-text-muted);\n}\n\n.admin-subtabs {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 6px;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n  padding-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.asub-btn {\n  padding: 6px 12px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  background: #ffffff;\n  font-size: 0.76rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.asub-btn.active {\n  background: var(--primary-dark);\n  color: #ffffff;\n  border-color: var(--primary-dark);\n}\n\n.admin-subpane {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.admin-subpane.active {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.table-responsive {\n  width: 100%;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.admin-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.admin-table th {\n  background: #f1f5f9;\n  padding: 10px 8px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #475569;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.admin-tab